ing portfolio consists of 76 primarily luxury and upper-upscale hotels containing approximately 41,700 rooms, with substantially all located in the United States (five of the hotels are located outside of the U.S. in Brazil and Canada). In addition, we own non-controlling interests in seven domestic joint ventures that focus on the lodging industry, see \" - Other Real Estate Interests\" for a further description.","zh":"我們是最大的公開交易住宿房地產投資信託基金，擁有分佈廣泛的豪華和高檔飯店組合。截至 2026 年 2 月 20 日，我們的綜合住宿組合由 76 家主要豪華和高檔酒店組成，包含約 41,700 間客房，基本上全部位於美國（其中 5 家酒店位於美國境外的巴西和加拿大）。此外，我們還擁有七家國內合資企業的非控制權益，這些企業專注於住宿業，詳細說明請參閱「-其他房地產權益」。"},{"en":"Host Inc. was incorporated as a Maryland corporation in 1998 and operates as a self-managed and self-administered REIT. Host Inc. owns hotels and conducts operations through Host L.P., of which Host Inc. is the sole general partner and of which it holds approximately 99% of the partnership interests (\"OP units\") as of December 31, 2025. The remaining partnership interests are owned by various unaffiliated limited partners. Host Inc. has the exclusive and complete responsibility for Host L.P.'s day-to-day management and control.","zh":"Host Inc. 於 1998 年在馬裡蘭州註冊成立，作為一家自我管理和自我管理的房地產投資信託基金運作。 Host Inc. 擁有飯店並透過 Host L.P. 開展業務，Host Inc. 是 Host L.P. 的唯一普通合夥人，截至 2025 年 12 月 31 日，Host Inc. 持有 Host L.P. 約 99% 的合夥權益（「OP 單位」）。其餘合夥權益由多個非關聯有限合夥人擁有。 Host Inc. 對 Host L.P. 的日常管理和控制負有獨家且完整的責任。"},{"en":"Our goal is to be the preeminent owner of high-quality lodging real estate in growing markets in the U.S. and to generate superior long-term risk adjusted returns for our stockholders throughout all phases of the lodging cycle through a combination of appreciation in asset values, growth in earnings and the payment of dividends. The pillars of our strategy to achieve this objective and elevate our growth profile include:","zh":"我們的目標是成為美國不斷成長的市場中優質住宿房地產的卓越所有者，並透過資產增值、收益成長和股息支付的結合，在住宿週期的所有階段為我們的股東創造卓越的長期風險調整回報。我們實現這一目標並提升成長前景的策略支柱包括："}],"markets":[],"customers":[],"competition":[{"en":"The lodging industry is highly competitive. Competition often is specific to individual markets and is based on several factors, including location, brand, guest facilities and amenities, level of service, room rates and the quality of accommodations. The lodging industry is viewed as consisting of six different categories, each of which caters to a discrete set of customer tastes and needs: luxury, upper upscale, upscale, upper midscale, midscale and economy. The classification of a hotel is based on lodging industry standards, which take into consideration many factors, such as guest facilities and amenities, level of service and quality of accommodations. Most of our hotels operate in urban and resort markets either as luxury properties under such brand names as 1 Hotels , Alila , Andaz , Fairmont , Grand Hyatt , JW Marriott , Ritz-Carlton , The Don Cesar , The Luxury Collection and W","zh":"住宿業競爭激烈。競爭通常針對各個市場，並基於多種因素，包括地點、品牌、賓客設施和便利設施、服務水準、房價和住宿品質。旅館業被視為由六個不同的類別組成，每個類別都迎合不同的客戶品味和需求：豪華型、高檔型、高檔型、中高檔型、中檔型和經濟型。飯店的分類是基於住宿行業標準，該標準考慮了許多因素，例如賓客設施和設施、服務等級和住宿品質。我們的大部分酒店在城市和度假村市場以豪華酒店的形式運營，品牌包括 1 Hotels、Alila、Andaz、Fairmont、Grand Hyatt、JW Marriott、Ritz-Carlton、The Don Cesar、The Luxury Collection 和 W"},{"en":"We also compete with other REITs and other public and private investors for the acquisition of new properties and investment opportunities as we attempt to position our portfolio to best take advantage of changes in markets and travel patterns of our customers.","zh":"我們也與其他房地產投資信託基金以及其他公共和私人投資者競爭收購新房地產和投資機會，因為我們試圖調整我們的投資組合，以最好地利用市場和客戶旅行模式的變化。"}],"segments":{"prod":{"end":"2025-12-31","items":[{"name":"Hotel","val":6015000000,"zh":"飯店"},{"name":"Occupancy","val":3608000000,"zh":"佔用"},{"name":"Food & Beverage","val":1803000000,"zh":"食品及飲料"},{"name":"Hotel Other","val":604000000,"zh":"飯店其他"},{"name":"Home Building","val":99000000,"zh":"居家建設"}],"total":6114000000},"geo":{"end":"2025-12-31","items":[{"name":"US","val":6010000000,"zh":"美國"},{"name":"CA","val":76000000,"zh":"加拿大"},{"name":"BR","val":28000000,"zh":"BR"}],"total":6114000000}},"peers":["KIM","BXP","VMRK","REG","UDR"]}}